    "text": "Fiserv Says ‘Just Scratching Surface’ for Clover, But Slowing Growth Slams Shares\nBy PYMNTS,\n11 hours agoBut as the company trimmed guidance for 2025, and as Clover’s momentum appeared to slow in the second quarter, investors sent the shares down 20% in early trading. Supplemental materials that accompanied the earnings announcement revealed that Clover volumes were up 8% roughly flat with the first quarter growth rate; VAS penetration was flat at about 24%.",
